  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵Fiddler 是我在 Windows 上最喜歡的除錯代理。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "通常，我使用 Python 編寫簡單的除錯代理，通常少於 30 行，直到它需要 https。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這就是為什麼我在 Fiddler 上的第一個配置是解密 HTTPS 流量，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "勾選 Decrypt HTTPS traffic 並點擊 OK。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然後它會要求安裝信任根憑證，↵ ↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可怕的文字是關於 https 流量被 Fiddler 看到的警告。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fiddler 的根憑證現在受信任，這意味著 Fiddler 可以生成您的應用程式（包括您的瀏覽器）信任的憑證。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果它沒有提示您安裝憑證，您可以使用以下方式安裝憑證，↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以透過選擇多個請求，然後按 R 來執行非常簡單的負載測試。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "請注意，來自伺服器的回應可能會在基礎設施的不同層級中快取。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以從時間軸看到伺服器的效能如何。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有時您甚至可以透過檢查時間軸來查看 Windows 上的傳出連線數量限制。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您也可以在發送請求之前修改它，↵ ↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食譜",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    }
  ],
